graph TD
    A[Client: POST /adventures] --> B[Backend: Create Placeholder Adventure & Avatar]
    B --> C[Backend: Start Background Generation Task]
    CAT[(Style & Tone Catalog)] -.-> D
    C --> D[WorldGenerator: generate_world]
    D --> E[LLM: Analyze Story Prompt & Tone]
    E --> F[Generate WorldManifesto<br/>(Plot, Rules, Walkthrough, Win/Loss Conditions,<br/>Scenes, Exits, NPCs, Objects, Switches, Containers, Quests, Awards)]
    F --> V{Validate Manifest Schema & Graph}
    V -- Invalid --> E
    V -- Valid --> G[WorldManifestApplier: apply_manifest]
    G --> H[Clear Existing World Baseline]
    H --> I[Sync Protagonist to Avatar]
    I --> J[Generate Cover & Protagonist Visuals]
    J --> K[Iterate & Create WorldScenes]
    K --> L[Generate Scene Backgrounds]
    L --> M[Iterate & Create NPCs with Voices]
    M --> N[Generate NPC Character Portraits]
    N --> O[Iterate & Create Objects: Containers, Switches & Items]
    O --> P[Generate Object Concept Art]
    P --> Q[Initialize Quests & Awards]
    Q --> R[Connect WorldExits with Lock Gates]
    R --> S[Update Adventure Status: Ready]
    S --> T[End Background Task]
